# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RULE 1: no roster data in this repository, in any format, ever.
# A public repo's commit history survives deleting the file. There is no undo.
# CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) fails the build if any of these slip through.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.CSV
*.xlsx
*.XLSX
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.tsv
*.numbers
*.ods
roster*
Roster*
ROSTER*
*roster*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Youth imagery never belongs in this repo. See CONTENT.md.
# (No blanket image ignore, so this is a review rule, not a tooling one.)

